		"§6Tree of Time§r was reworked.\n\n§2●§r Speeds up §aALL blocks§r in an §68-block radius§r.  \n§2●§r Affects only §e\"random ticks\"§r and does §cNOT§r speed up §bTile Entities§r.  \n§2●§r Disables all other §6Timewood Clocks§r in its working area.  \n§2●§r Destroys itself if the tree's structure is §cseverely damaged§r.\n\n§7§lTile Entities:§r §8Active blocks that perform actions each tick, like powered machines, hoppers, or miners.  \n§7§lRandom Ticking Blocks:§r §8Static blocks that rarely change state, such as plants, vines, grass, or bog earth.  \n\n§8§oNote: Forestry Leaves/Saplings and IC2 Crops are considered Tile Entities.§r"
